// The secrets device with no keyring to talk to (no session bus): nothing
// is kept, nothing read, and the program does not wait. (Tests do not
// see the user's keyring: secrets_keyring.test does, where asked for.)
// RUN: %ent build %S/Inputs/secrets_kept.ent -o %t.program
// RUN: env DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS=unix:path=/nonexistent %t.program | FileCheck %s

// CHECK:      available false
// CHECK-NEXT: kept false [] other []
// CHECK-NEXT: again false [] forgotten false []
